{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2022-02-08 09:39:00', 'title': 'TRUIST INSURANCE HOLDINGS TO ACQUIRE KENSINGTON VANGUARD NATIONAL LAND SERVICES', 'text': "CHARLOTTE, N.C., FEB. 8, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TRUIST INSURANCE HOLDINGS, INC., A SUBSIDIARY OF TRUIST FINANCIAL CORPORATION AND THE SIXTH-LARGEST INSURANCE BROKERAGE IN THE U.S., ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE KENSINGTON VANGUARD NATIONAL LAND SERVICES, ONE OF THE COUNTRY'S LARGEST INDEPENDENT FULL-SERVICE NATIONAL TITLE INSURANCE AGENCIES."}